OL,3,AGraduate job vacancies drop by almost
OL,4,A50% in a year, survey suggests
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses have said employer national
OL,7,Finsurance and minimum wage hikes have
OL,8,Fmade hiring more expensive,
OL,9,Fparticularly for junior staff.
